  "description": "Roy isn't your average crime-fighting agent. She sees visions in her dreams-visions that come true soon after. Using this gift of foresight, she predicts crimes ahead of time. One night, she has a dream about making passionate love to a man she had never seen before, which makes her uneasy because her dreams always become real. What's more, this man keeps popping up in the crime scenes she foresees. Just who is this mysterious man? Why does he keep showing up in her dreams and reality?\n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
